killed people himself, and then I thought,

00:02:49.819 --> 00:02:52.412
you know, probably, US presidents have also
killed people, so I looked it up.

00:02:52.412 --> 00:02:55.410
And it turns out lots of US presidents have
killed people, but mostly in combat.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:59.960
